  "notes": "{加盟|かめい} refers to formally joining an organization, alliance, or agreement as a member. Used for countries joining international bodies, stores joining franchises, companies joining associations, etc.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {加盟|かめい}⟦{国|こく}→国：02204_kuni⟧: member nation\n- {加盟|かめい}⟦{店|てん}→店：10011_ten⟧: member/affiliated store\n- {加盟|かめい}⟦{企業|きぎょう}→企業：00225_kigyou⟧: member company\n- {加盟|かめい}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{申|もう}し{込|こ}む→申し込む：02311_moushikomu⟧: to apply for membership\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{脱退|だったい}→脱退：05770_dattai⟧: withdrawal (from an organization)\n- ⟦{離脱|りだつ}→離脱：14583_ridatsu⟧: withdrawal, secession (often political)\n- ⟦{参加|さんか}→参加：02498_sanka⟧: participation (broader, less formal commitment)\n- ⟦{入会|にゅうかい}→入会：11671_nyuukai⟧: joining (a club/society, typically smaller scale)\n- {加盟|かめい} implies formal, institutional membership",
